<h1>05_言语表达、修辞争辩与信息传递 (Communication, Rhetoric, Debate & Disclosure)</h1>
<p style='color:#64748b;margin-bottom:14px;'>本领域共 <b>197</b> 个核心动词 • 右侧直接展示 <b>💬 口语 Phrasal Verb 短语替换 ↔ ⚖️ 通用同义词 ↔ 🏛️ 正式学术升级词</b></p>
<div class="sub-nav"><button class='ctrl-btn' onclick='toggleAllSections(true)'>📂 全部展开</button><button class='ctrl-btn secondary' onclick='toggleAllSections(false)'>📁 全部收起</button><button class='sub-pill' onclick="filterRegister('all')">全部动词</button><button class='sub-pill' onclick="filterRegister('phrasal')">🔄 仅看含 Phrasal Verb 替换</button><button class='sub-pill' onclick="filterRegister('Formal')">🏛️ 仅看正式/学术语域</button><button class='sub-pill' onclick="filterRegister('Vivid')">🎨 仅看生动/叙事动词</button><span style='color:#fcd34d;margin:0 4px;'>|</span><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_0')">01_陈述、宣告、阐明与暗示低语 (74)</a><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_1')">02_争辩、反驳、劝说与游说谈判 (31)</a><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_2')">03_赞美、吹捧、谴责、诽谤与抱怨 (13)</a><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_3')">04_揭露、隐瞒、捏造与传播散布 (79)</a></div>
<details class='sub-section' id='sub_0' open><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>01_陈述、宣告、阐明与暗示低语 (Articulating, Proclaiming, Murmuring & Hinting)</span><span class='sub-meta'>共 74 词 • 点击展开 / 收起</span></summary><table><tr><th width='19%'>核心动词 & 语域层级</th><th width='12%'>音标 / 发音</th><th width='19%'>中文释义</th><th width='18%'>英文精准定义</th><th width='5%'>词频</th><th width='27%'>🔄 Phrasal Verb 替换 & 语域阶梯</th></tr>
<tr data-reg='Neutral' data-pv='1'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>recommend<span class='reg-Neutral'>⚖️ 通用核心</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>préconiser<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 1er gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to recommend</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/.rekә'mend/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/pʁekɔnize/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('recommend', 'préconiser')">🔊</button></td><td>vt. 推荐, 介绍, 劝告, 使受欢迎, 托付</td><td class='def-en'>push for something</td><td>4.61</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>💬 <b>短语动词 (Phrasal):</b> <span class='pv-pill'>come up with</span><span class='pv-pill'>put forward</span></div><div>🏛️ <b>正式/学术升级:</b> <span class='fm-pill'>advocate</span><span class='fm-pill'>commend</span></div><div>⚖️ <b>通用同义替换:</b> <span class='nt-pill'>urge</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“The travel agent recommended strongly that we not travel on Thanksgiving Day”</div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-reg='Neutral' data-pv='1'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>defend<span class='reg-Neutral'>⚖️ 通用核心</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>aider<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 1er gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to defend</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/di'fend/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/ɛde/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('defend', 'aider')">🔊</button></td><td>vt. 防护, 辩护, 防卫</td><td class='def-en'>argue or speak in defense of</td><td>4.47</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>💬 <b>短语动词 (Phrasal):</b> <span class='pv-pill'>fend for</span><span class='pv-pill'>stand up</span><span class='pv-pill'>stick up</span></div><div>🏛️ <b>正式/学术升级:</b> <span class='fm-pill'>support</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“She supported the motion to strike”</div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-reg='Neutral' data-pv='1'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>argue<span class='reg-Neutral'>⚖️ 通用核心</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>affirmer<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 1er gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to argue</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'ɑ:gju/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/afiʁme/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('argue', 'affirmer')">🔊</button></td><td>vi. 提出理由, 争论, 辩论；vt. 主张, 辩论, 证明, 说服</td><td class='def-en'>present reasons and arguments</td><td>4.46</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>💬 <b>短语动词 (Phrasal):</b> <span class='pv-pill'>fend for</span><span class='pv-pill'>lay out</span></div><div>🏛️ <b>正式/学术升级:</b> <span class='fm-pill'>contend</span></div><div>⚖️ <b>通用同义替换:</b> <span class='nt-pill'>reason</span><span class='nt-pill'>debate</span><span class='nt-pill'>fence</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“They decided to argue (present reasons and arguments).”</div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-reg='Neutral' data-pv='1'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>shout<span class='reg-Neutral'>⚖️ 通用核心</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>cri<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 3e gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to shout</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/ʃaut/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/kʁi/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('shout', 'cri')">🔊</button></td><td>vi. 呼喊, 喊叫, 嚷；vt. 高喊</td><td class='def-en'>utter in a loud voice; talk in a loud voice (usually denoting characteristic manner of speaking)</td><td>4.06</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>💬 <b>短语动词 (Phrasal):</b> <span class='pv-pill'>holler out</span><span class='pv-pill'>shout out</span></div><div>⚖️ <b>通用同义替换:</b> <span class='nt-pill'>cry</span><span class='nt-pill'>call</span><span class='nt-pill'>yell</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“My grandmother is hard of hearing--you'll have to shout”</div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-reg='Neutral' data-pv='1'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>declare<span class='reg-Neutral'>⚖️ 通用核心</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>déclarer<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 1er gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to declare</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/di'klєә/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/deklaʁe/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('declare', 'déclarer')">🔊</button></td><td>v. 宣布, 声明, 申报, 断言</td><td class='def-en'>state emphatically and authoritatively</td><td>4.05</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>💬 <b>短语动词 (Phrasal):</b> <span class='pv-pill'>answer for</span></div><div>⚖️ <b>通用同义替换:</b> <span class='nt-pill'>announce</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“He declared that he needed more money to carry out the task he was charged with”</div></div></td></tr>
