<details class='sub-section' id='sub_1'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>02_争辩、反驳、劝说与游说谈判 (Refuting, Persuading, Lobbying & Negotiating)</span><span class='sub-meta'>共 31 词 • 点击展开 / 收起</span></summary><table><tr><th width='19%'>核心动词 & 语域层级</th><th width='12%'>音标 / 发音</th><th width='19%'>中文释义</th><th width='18%'>英文精准定义</th><th width='5%'>词频</th><th width='27%'>🔄 Phrasal Verb 替换 & 语域阶梯</th></tr>
<tr data-reg='Neutral' data-pv='1'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>moderate<span class='reg-Neutral'>⚖️ 通用核心</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>aboutir<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 2e gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to moderate</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'mɒdәrәt/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/abutiʁ/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('moderate', 'aboutir')">🔊</button></td><td>vt. 节制, 减轻, 使缓和；vi. 变缓和, 主持会议</td><td class='def-en'>preside over</td><td>4.27</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>💬 <b>短语动词 (Phrasal):</b> <span class='pv-pill'>hash out</span><span class='pv-pill'>talk over</span></div><div>⚖️ <b>通用同义替换:</b> <span class='nt-pill'>chair</span><span class='nt-pill'>lead</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“John moderated the discussion”</div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-reg='Neutral' data-pv='1'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>convince<span class='reg-Neutral'>⚖️ 通用核心</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>abattre<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 3e gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to convince</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/kәn'vins/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/abatʁ/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('convince', 'abattre')">🔊</button></td><td>vt. 说服, 使相信</td><td class='def-en'>make (someone) agree, understand, or realize the truth or validity of something</td><td>4.26</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>💬 <b>短语动词 (Phrasal):</b> <span class='pv-pill'>win over</span></div><div>🏛️ <b>正式/学术升级:</b> <span class='fm-pill'>convert</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“He had finally convinced several customers of the advantages of his product”</div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-reg='Neutral' data-pv='1'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>advise<span class='reg-Neutral'>⚖️ 通用核心</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>conseiller<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 1er gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to advise</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/әd'vaiz/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/kɔ̃seje/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('advise', 'conseiller')">🔊</button></td><td>vt. 劝告, 给...出主意, 通知, 建议；vi. 提意见, 商量</td><td class='def-en'>give advice to</td><td>4.09</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>💬 <b>短语动词 (Phrasal):</b> <span class='pv-pill'>give notice</span><span class='pv-pill'>hash out</span><span class='pv-pill'>send word</span></div><div>🏛️ <b>正式/学术升级:</b> <span class='fm-pill'>apprise</span><span class='fm-pill'>apprize</span></div><div>⚖️ <b>通用同义替换:</b> <span class='nt-pill'>rede</span><span class='nt-pill'>counsel</span><span class='nt-pill'>notify</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“The teacher counsels troubled students”</div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-reg='Neutral' data-pv='1'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>intermediate<span class='reg-Neutral'>⚖️ 通用核心</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>allier<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 1er gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to intermediate</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/.intә'mi:diәt/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/alje/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('intermediate', 'allier')">🔊</button></td><td>vi. 起媒介作用</td><td class='def-en'>act between parties with a view to reconciling differences</td><td>4.04</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>💬 <b>短语动词 (Phrasal):</b> <span class='pv-pill'>talk terms</span></div><div>🏛️ <b>正式/学术升级:</b> <span class='fm-pill'>intercede</span><span class='fm-pill'>mediate</span><span class='fm-pill'>arbitrate</span></div><div>⚖️ <b>通用同义替换:</b> <span class='nt-pill'>liaise</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“He interceded in the family dispute”</div></div></td></tr>
