<tr data-reg='Neutral' data-pv='1'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>reflect<span class='reg-Neutral'>⚖️ 通用核心</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>correspondre<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 3e gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to reflect</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/ri'flekt/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/kɔʁɛspɔ̃dʁ/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('reflect', 'correspondre')">🔊</button></td><td>vt. 反射, 反映, 招致, 深思；vi. 被反射, 映出, 深思, 考虑, 指责</td><td class='def-en'>manifest or bring back</td><td>4.39</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>💬 <b>短语动词 (Phrasal):</b> <span class='pv-pill'>chew over</span><span class='pv-pill'>mull over</span><span class='pv-pill'>think over</span></div><div>🏛️ <b>正式/学术升级:</b> <span class='fm-pill'>meditate</span><span class='fm-pill'>excogitate</span><span class='fm-pill'>contemplate</span></div><div>⚖️ <b>通用同义替换:</b> <span class='nt-pill'>ponder</span><span class='nt-pill'>muse</span><span class='nt-pill'>mull</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“This action reflects his true beliefs”</div></div></td></tr>
